Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Read this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A firefly's light...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.11,0:00:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you read, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can read perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Night fell, and it got dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The man in the moon must be taking a night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You skipped part again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ummm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're always so dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man, she's screwing up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in session now, so I'm going to have to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you fell again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fell again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato! What are you doing at a time like this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you get better at reading picture books.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine. I know you will someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to practice so I can make everyone happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to get better at reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly had lived alone for a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So long he completely forgot he was even a firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Living alone is lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seemed like something good might happen this dark night, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Why don't you knock it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you, stop reading that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:05:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He gives me a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that old guy from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He seems way different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he's worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have a home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you asking{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, I'd stayed in the park until just now too,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but now thanks to Miss Sayaka and Chitose I can sleep on a nice fluffy mattress!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mattresses are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you stay at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to rely on someone I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato. This is Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did he get so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly saw a pretty light far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wondering what it was, he got closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really am dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I overslept again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're completely dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're late, Fujimoto is going to chew you out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning. How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here about payment on a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A loan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They seem pretty dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I love kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you gonna apologize for running into me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The hell are you doing? Lemme go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your hands off the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you not to come while we were in session!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you to tell us what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's your fault for not paying up, right, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get full of yourself just because the boss is a nice guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll talk with you after we close. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll get out of here as soon as you pay us back, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, hurry up and pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:08:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time to play with kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Police!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help! There's a stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, we'll leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we'll be back for our money!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just faking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought if I yelled "police" they'd leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.07,0:10:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're really gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko, you're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If they come back, I'll chase them off again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad for you, Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But how long do you expect me to stay like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So they made that phone call yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They seem to be giving Miss Sayaka a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.19,0:11:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if I pay them back, that will heal Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's there again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. No problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're having any trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really troubled. I have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here because I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The picture book yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I borrowed it from the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've practiced, but I'm still not good at reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone likes this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I want to be good at{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, don't read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You hate this picture book that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're my neighbor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.57,0:13:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A man at the park told me not to read this picture book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you've met Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something to do with Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, he's the one that wrote that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's well-known around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But why did he tell me not to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I've heard that's the last book he wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.09,0:14:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His last book?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the banks of a pretty stream lived a single firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly had lived alone for a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So long he forgot he was even a firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One dark, moonless night,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly saw a pretty light far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wondering what it was, he got closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and saw that it was a girl bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.37,0:14:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"You're pretty. What kind of bug are you?", he asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"A firefly, just like you." she answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And she asked the firefly, "why don't you glow?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly had lived alone so long that he had forgotten how.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The girl firefly taught the saddened firefly how to glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After that, the two lived and glowed happily together on the banks of that stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe that old guy forgot how to glow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know why, but he's like the firefly in that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I can cheer him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what're you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.89,0:15:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you doing anything tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go looking for fireflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be waiting at the stream by Mt. Hachiman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can glow just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you can remember how to glow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He ain't coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I kinda had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fireflies aren't out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Let's go looking for fireflies. I'll wait for you at the stream by Mt. Hachiman."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Naoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was my lover...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She... Naoko drew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She wanted a story about fireflies, so I wrote it and then she drew the pictures after.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go looking for fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.17,0:17:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You promised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.82,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, I found a great spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wait for you at the stream by Mt. Hachiman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never ended up going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:43.92,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was so busy with deadlines back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So she went alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:18:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She said it was beautiful, and she had wanted so badly to show me it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her art seemed so lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I rewrote my story to be lonely, yet beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And once the book was done, I had some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You finally have time off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'll be waiting in the park like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko! Hey, Naoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sotaro...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.57,0:18:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want anything? I'll go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to see the fireflies with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't I go with her then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She wanted to go with me so badly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we just wait a little longer, they'll{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is where Naoko drew...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, you've never seen fireflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go see them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotta see the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't any left around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show you them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Promise, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fireflies are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like the old guy remembered how to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's going to write again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, this proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That you healed the old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to help Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time you get 100 points, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is what I want to say, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.61,0:22:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Deducting for how you treated me at the library...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,80 points, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.95,0:22:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better get serious from here on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, I was being way too lenient with 80 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Should've gone for 50 or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! 80 is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,79 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:22:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:45.23,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:53.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:01:03.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.83,0:01:09.13,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:16.88,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:22.56,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:27.77,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:34.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:39.74,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.74,0:01:46.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:55.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1125,1125)\pos(424,166)}... Firefly promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:08.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.86,0:23:15.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.29,0:23:23.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:32.34,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:43.35,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:46.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:54.49,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.49,0:24:01.58,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.37,0:24:11.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.17,0:24:15.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.97,0:24:28.40,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... Little hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
